# Firebase's x86_64 desktop stub for the App module - only used for local
# Editor Play-mode testing, never touched by real Android/iOS builds. Too
# large (180MB+) to distribute via a git-URL UPM dependency (Unity's git
# package resolver doesn't reliably support Git LFS), so it's kept local-only.
# Copy it in manually from a real Firebase Unity SDK download if you want to
# Play-test Firebase Messaging in the Editor.
